# --- TDLib artifacts (built locally via tools/build-tdlib.sh) ---
# The .so binaries and the generated Java bindings are build outputs, not
# source. Anyone cloning this runs tools/build-tdlib.sh to reproduce them —
# which is also the only way to know what OpenSSL your crypto is linked to.
app/src/main/jniLibs/
app/src/main/java/org/drinkless/
app/src/main/tdlib-build-info.txt
tools/*.log
docs/ui-overhaul-plan.md
HardPlay_PRD.md
CLAUDE.md

# Local device/debug artefacts. Never publish: a logcat capture contains chat ids
# and file paths, a pulled APK contains the compiled api_id, and a screenshot of
# this app is either blank (FLAG_SECURE) or shows real library content.
tools/shots/
tools/tmp/
CLAUDE.md
